                    VIET. Secret; Immediate; Eyes Only. The source text is a copy sent by the CIA to the Department of State exclusive for
                        Rusk, Ball, Harriman, and
                        Hilsman. Copies were also sent to the
                    White House exclusive for Bundy and to
                    the Assistant Chief of Staff (Intelligence), Department of the Army, exclusive
                    for McNamara, Gilpatric, Taylor, and Krulak.
                    Received at the Department of State at 7:24 p.m.</p>
            </note>
